Meta.documentation:octetstream
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:application/octet-stream — binary byte array, the universal
Meta.documentation:transport value. Holds a JavaScript Uint8Array.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:http:, file: and Dawn.cast produce octetstreams for binary
Meta.documentation:content (image/*, octet-stream, anything unmapped); the
Meta.documentation:octetstream interface (in_octetstream_$all / out_octetstream)
Meta.documentation:is how value resources convert to and from bytes.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:file:public/images/favicon.png?read>>Console:
